  "clinical_evidence": [
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Better, I think? But I'm worried it isn't working as fast as it should. My heart is still racing sometimes.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:18",
      "end_timestamp": "00:28",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Tell me more about the racing. How often does it happen?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:29",
      "end_timestamp": "00:36",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "A few times a week. Usually at night when I'm sitting down, which seems strange. Shouldn't it happen when I'm active?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:38",
      "end_timestamp": "00:49",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Maybe ten minutes. I count the seconds, which probably makes it worse.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:02",
      "end_timestamp": "01:09",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's very understandable. And what about being hot all the time, which you described before? How's that?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:10",
      "end_timestamp": "01:20",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Gone, honestly. It settled after the second week. I stopped sleeping with the window wide open.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:22",
      "end_timestamp": "01:31",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's a useful sign. Any chest pain when your heart races?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:33",
      "end_timestamp": "01:40",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No. Just the pounding. Should I be worried it's my heart?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:42",
      "end_timestamp": "01:49",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Let me finish my questions and I'll answer that properly. First, any double vision or discomfort in your eyes?",
      "start_timestamp": "01:50",
      "end_timestamp": "02:00",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, my eyes are fine, thank goodness.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:02",
      "end_timestamp": "02:06",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Good. Now let's go through your medicines. Start with the thyroid one.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:09",
      "end_timestamp": "02:15",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Methimazole. I think it's maybe 20 milligrams? Once a day, in the morning. I'd have to check the bottle.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:17",
      "end_timestamp": "02:26",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "That's okay, we'll confirm it against the pharmacy record. What else do you take?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:29",
      "end_timestamp": "02:37",
      "supports": [
        "medications[1]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Propranolol, 40 milligrams twice a day, for the racing heart. And a multivitamin once a day.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:39",
      "end_timestamp": "02:48",
      "supports": [
        "medications[1]",
        "medications[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Any allergies to medicines or anything else?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:49",
      "end_timestamp": "02:53",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "No, none that I know of.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:55",
      "end_timestamp": "02:58",
      "supports": [
        "negative_findings[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "The Graves' disease, that's what they called it. And high blood pressure, but that's mild.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:08",
      "end_timestamp": "03:17",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I can see a fine tremor in both hands. Eyes open now.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:39",
      "end_timestamp": "03:45",
      "supports": [
        "physical_examination[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "From what you've told me, I think your thyroid is still a bit overactive, but heading in the right direction. The hot feeling going away is part of that, and the racing is the thyroid hormone pushing on the heart, not damage to it.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:40",
      "end_timestamp": "05:00",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Not today. Changing a dose without a fresh blood test is guessing. I'd like to repeat the thyroid blood test in about four weeks, and then decide with real numbers.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:09",
      "end_timestamp": "05:25",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Then ring the clinic and tell them, don't wait for the test. That's what the number is for.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:35",
      "end_timestamp": "05:46",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Cut out coffee and tea after lunch, and try slow breathing when it starts. It won't cure it, but it helps some people feel more in control.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:56",
      "end_timestamp": "06:09",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[2]"
      ]
